{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266UZCDmLDYB1794887210.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>標準普爾預期，明年樓價將保持穩定。</p><p></p><p>報告預期，本輪加息幅度相對溫和，加上住宅租金持續上升及新盤庫存減少，意味樓市只會暫緩復蘇，而不會逆轉。預期本港樓價全年上升百分之7至8後，明年將維持穩定。新盤成交則從今年約2萬伙，放緩至明年約1.7萬伙。由於發展商已大幅降低槓桿比率，即使樓價大跌兩成半或投資物業估值下跌半成，地產商仍有能力應對加息環境，評級不受影響。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.405078+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T03:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T17:11:05.923250+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:45.489779+00:00","content_hash":"d3f12a111ec8052f30bff7fb41debf0d2ee4c0e926a46285304e19ca0a585284","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:48:19.405078+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}